  - m_Id: 53583433728
    m_Localized: "Willow\u2019s kibble doesn\u2019t pay for itself!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69861527552
    m_Localized: Carlos also has to pay the ChatGPT subscription to keep developing
      video games!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83283300352
    m_Localized: A good cup of coffee will help Carlos make his games with more enthusiasm!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133010968576
    m_Localized: Carlos also wants to pay the Dofus subscription to keep inspiring
